{"page":65,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:116","surah":3,"ayah":116,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَن تُغْنِىَ عَنْهُمْ أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ وَلَآ أَوْلَـٰدُهُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ شَيْـًٔا ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ ۚ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who disbelieve, neither their possessions nor their children will help them against God- they will be companions in the Fire, there to remain-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُغْنِىَ","en_gloss":"will avail","transliteration":"tugh'niya","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"[for] them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwāluhum","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدُهُم","en_gloss":"their children","transliteration":"awlāduhum","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۖ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"and those","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"3:116"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"3:116