"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"3:119"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"(is in) the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"3:119"},{"pos":28,"ar":"١١٩","en_gloss":"(119)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:119"}]},{"verse_key":"3:120","surah":3,"ayah":120,"ar_uthmani":"إِن تَمْسَسْكُمْ حَسَنَةٌ تَسُؤْهُمْ وَإِن تُصِبْكُمْ سَيِّئَةٌ يَفْرَحُوا۟ بِهَا ۖ وَإِن تَصْبِرُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ لَا يَضُرُّكُمْ كَيْدُهُمْ شَيْـًٔا ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِمَا يَعْمَلُونَ مُحِيطٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They grieve at any good that befalls you [believers] and rejoice at your misfortunes. But if you are steadfast and conscious of God, their scheming will not harm you in the least: God encircles everything they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَمْسَسْكُمْ","en_gloss":"touches you","transliteration":"tamsaskum","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَسَنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a good","transliteration":"ḥasanatun","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَسُؤْهُمْ","en_gloss":"it grieves them","transliteration":"tasu'hum","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُصِبْكُمْ","en_gloss":"strikes you","transliteration":"tuṣib'kum","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَيِّئَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"misfortune","transliteration":"sayyi-atun","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَفْرَحُوا۟","en_gloss":"they rejoice","transliteration":"yafraḥū","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"at it","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَصْبِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"you are patient","transliteration":"taṣbirū","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear (Allah)","transliteration":"watattaqū","verse_key":"3:120"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"n